; The caravan's cook-fire — the yard's own warm point, away from the road's braziers.
; --- 38Q2: the caravan board ------------------------------------------------------------------
; Rotating supply contracts, posted where the carts actually load. Same CONTRACT as the Embermarket's
; notice board and town_hub's guild marker — a prop entity, a collider and ONE component — and the ⚠️
; on those applies again: an entity gets one interactable, so this carries a ServiceComponent and
; nothing else, forever.
;
; ⚠️ THE THIRD BOARD IN THE REALM AND THEY MUST READ APART. The guild board STARTS A QUEST; the market
; notice is deliberately effect-free gossip; this one moves goods and never touches the journal. They
; stand in three different cells and are never in view of one another.
;
